WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.078
AI made content abundant.
Market learning is the new advantage.

00:06.350 --> 00:10.790
Every search, save, and purchase
carries a trace of intent.

00:13.350 --> 00:20.118
Molly follows those traces, tests them against live evidence,
and turns them into one media decision.

00:25.350 --> 00:33.294
For one after-work question, 120 live notes became five opportunities
and one human job: let the evening begin.

00:36.350 --> 00:41.726
That decision travels through production, verification,
publishing, and outcome readback.

00:49.450 --> 00:54.130
Media is the output.
Continuous market learning is the product.

00:57.150 --> 01:00.294
Molly. A behavior-led media operator.
